{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL0F0dGVudGlvbiUyMEF0dGVudGlvbiUyMCUyODIwMjElMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Attention Attention","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9KIIfabZu8aW7Pu3krDgSmsMX2g.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2pDG5j6yuT5thrPcGNiM4ewlxb3.jpg","description":"Multi-platinum band Shinedown invites viewers into the world of ATTENTION ATTENTION in their new film, bringing to life the story of the acclaimed album of the same name. A stunning sonic and visual work of art, the film weaves the 14 songs from the album into a provocative, visceral and thought-provoking journey that brings viewers along on a psychological, emotional and physical ride from life's lowest lows to the highest highs. As anxieties dissipate and demons disappear, what emerges is a powerful and enduring statement about humanity, overcoming struggles, the importance of mental health, not being afraid to fail and the resolve of the human spirit.\n\nReleased 3 Sept 2021 · United States of America · Language: English · 64 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Music","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.8","runtime":"64 min","cast":["Brent Smith","Zach Myers","Eric Bass","Barry Kerch"],"director":["Bill Yukich"],"released":"2021-09-03T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Bill Yukich","character":"Director"},{"name":"Brent Smith","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fHjDQO6QMmdTwjvKTUYWP8mabMd.jpg"},{"name":"Zach Myers","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wEvmZPwKUSbnWwq8zH9i8v6ZInT.jpg"},{"name":"Eric Bass","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/49R7VYvB1svziHrIoubK91AbiIo.jpg"},{"name":"Barry Kerch","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4H9oxDk3pn48Tc0CtGWNhTxo8A7.jpg"}]},"writer":["Bill Yukich"],"country":"United States of America","language":"English","links":[{"name":"Brent Smith","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Brent%20Sm